otherwise.
sub07(_,_):- put_console(c#"*") | sub08.
sub07(-1234):- put_console(c#"h") | sub08.
otherwise.
sub07(_):- put_console(c#"*") | sub08.

sub08:- true | sub08(-1234,-1234).
